# Tech Stack

- **Framework**: TanStack Start (Next.js-like full-stack framework on top of TanStack Router)
- **Router**: TanStack Router (File-based routing in `src/routes`)
- **Data Fetching**: TanStack Query
- **UI library**: Shadcn UI + Tailwind CSS v4
- **Database**: Drizzle ORM + Better SQLite3
- **Validation**: Zod v4 (Use `zod` for all schema validation)
- **Authentication**: Better Auth
- **Forms**: TanStack Form (`@tanstack/react-form`)
- **Tooling**: Biome (Linting & Formatting)

# Architecture & Project Structure

- **Vertical Slice Architecture**: Organize complex domains in `src/features/<feature-name>`.
  - Structure: `components/`, `server/` (functions), `types/`, `utils/`, `*.queries.ts`.
- **Shared UI**: Reusable generic components go in `src/components/ui`.
- **Routes**: All pages are defined in `src/routes`. Use `createFileRoute` for type safety.
- **Server Functions**: Use `createServerFn` from `@tanstack/start` for API-like logic.

# UI & Design Principles

- **Aesthetic Skill**: Follow the [frontend-design](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/blob/main/plugins/frontend-design/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md) skill for all UI work.
- **Styling**:
  - Use Tailwind CSS v4 classes for the engine.
  - Define theme variables in `src/styles.css` using `@theme inline`.
  - Use `clsx` and `tailwind-merge` (via `cn` helper) for dynamic styles.
- **Typography & Layout**: Prioritize high-impact typography and unique spatial compositions (asymmetry/negative space).

# Coding Standards

- **Imports**: Use `@/` alias for all internal imports.
- **Exports**: Use **Named Exports** (`export function MyComponent`) for everything.
- **Type Safety**: NO `any`. Use strict Zod schemas for all API inputs/outputs. Export types from `types/` files if they are large.

# Specialized Patterns

## Data Fetching (TanStack Query)

- **Factories**: Define query/mutation options in `[feature].queries.ts`.
- **Global Feedback**: The `query-client.ts` handles toasts and invalidation via `meta` (successMessage, errorMessage, invalidates).

## Forms (TanStack Form)

- **Field Pattern**: Always use `<form.AppField>` (nested children) for type inference.
  - _Correct:_ `<form.AppField name="foo">{() => <TextField />}</form.AppField>`
- **Reference**: Follow patterns in `src/components/form/field-components.tsx`.
- **Validation**: Always try to define form/input validation in the feature module's schema file (`src/features/[module]/[module].schema.ts`) using `drizzle-zod`.
  - Use `createInsertSchema` to derive Zod schemas from Drizzle tables.
  - References: `src/features/users/users.schema.ts`, `src/features/lessons/lessons.schema.ts`.

# Tooling & Maintenance

- **Formatting**: Biome (Tabs, Double quotes). Run `pnpm format` to resolve issues.
- **Components**: Add via `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component-name>`.
- **Type Errors**: If TanStack Form properties are missing, run `pnpm run typecheck` to see the full error.
